{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it, grab it, check properties, perform task, otherwise scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
